lasticity in the human brain","authors":["Fernandes MA"],"year":2018,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":85,"keyFindings":["Drawing enhances memory through cross-modal brain plasticity","Drawing engages motor, visual, and semantic processing","Superior to writing for memory retention"]},{"title":"Keyword mnemonic and how to use it effectively","authors":["Pressley M","Levin JR"],"year":1982,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":85,"keyFindings":["Keyword mnemonic highly effective for vocabulary learning","Interactive imagery enhances keyword effectiveness","Systematic application guidelines established"]},{"title":"Emotion enhances remembering of neutral events past","authors":["Anderson AK","Yamaguchi Y"],"year":2006,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":82,"keyFindings":["Emotional context enhances memory for neutral information","Retroactive enhancement of memory by emotion","Emotional tagging can improve retention of mundane material"]},{"title":"Emotional arousal and memory binding","authors":["Mather M"],"year":2006,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":80,"keyFindings":["Emotional arousal enhances memory binding for central details","Amygdala-hippocampal interaction mediates emotional memory","Emotion can be leveraged for better encoding"]}]},{"id":"interleaving","name":"Interleaving","icon":"🔀","description":"Mixing different topics during practice improves discrimination and long-term retention.","practiceTip":"Practice across categories, not just one at a time — the Visual Matcher mode naturally interleaves topics.","papers":[{"title":"The interleaving effect: Mixing it up boosts learning","authors":["Rohrer D"],"year":2012,"evidenceLevel":"review","relevanceScore":92,"keyFindings":["Interleaving different topics enhances learning","Mixed practice superior to blocked practice for retention","Interleaving improves discrimination and transfer"]},{"title":"Interleaved practice improves mathematics learning","authors":["Rohrer D","Dedrick RF"],"year":2015,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":88,"keyFindings":["Interleaved math practice improves test scores","Benefits persist over extended retention intervals","Applicable to self-directed study schedules"]}]},{"id":"method-of-loci","name":"Method of Loci (Memory Palace)","icon":"🏛️","description":"Associating information with spatial locations in a familiar environment creates powerful memory anchors.","practiceTip":"Create a mental walk through your home — place each CSS property in a specific room for vivid recall.","papers":[{"title":"The method of loci in the context of psychological research: A systematic review and meta-analysis","authors":["Various"],"year":2025,"evidenceLevel":"meta_analysis","relevanceScore":95,"keyFindings":["Method of loci produces large effect sizes for memory","Effective across age groups and content types","Most studied and validated mnemonic strategy"]},{"title":"Durable memories and efficient neural coding through mnemonic training using the method of loci","authors":["Dresler M"],"year":2017,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":95,"keyFindings":["Method of loci training produces durable memory improvements","Training reshapes functional brain connectivity","Memory athletes and trained novices show similar brain patterns"]},{"title":"Mnemonic training reshapes brain networks to support superior memory","authors":["Dresler M"],"year":2017,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":95,"keyFindings":["Mnemonic training reorganizes brain network connectivity","Changes persist months after training","Novices can achieve memory champion-level performance"]},{"title":"Building a memory palace in minutes: Equivalent performance using virtual versus conventional environments","authors":["Legge ELG","Madan CR"],"year":2012,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":88,"keyFindings":["Virtual memory palaces as effective as physical ones","Rapid construction possible with digital tools","Accessibility of method of loci increased through VR"]},{"titl