aches have complementary benefits"]},{"title":"Near and far transfer effects of working memory training","authors":["Various"],"year":2025,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":88,"keyFindings":["Working memory training produces near transfer effects","Far transfer evidence mixed but present in some domains","Preregistered design increases confidence in findings"]},{"title":"Exploring the n-back task: Insights, applications, and future directions","authors":["Various"],"year":2025,"evidenceLevel":"review","relevanceScore":85,"keyFindings":["N-back task is a valid measure and training tool for working memory","Multiple variants available for different training goals","Future directions include adaptive and gamified versions"]},{"title":"Dual n-back training improves functional connectivity","authors":["Salminen T"],"year":2020,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":82,"keyFindings":["N-back training improves resting-state brain connectivity","Right inferior frontal gyrus connectivity enhanced","Neural changes persist after training cessation"]},{"title":"Transfer after dual n-back training depends on striatal activation change","authors":["Küper K","Karbach J"],"year":2016,"evidenceLevel":"rct","relevanceScore":85,"keyFindings":["Training transfer depends on striatal activation changes","Individual differences in neural response predict transfer","Neuroimaging can guide personalized training approaches"]}]},{"id":"mindfulness","name":"Mindfulness & Cognition","icon":"🧘","description":"Mindfulness meditation improves attention, working memory, and executive function through focused awareness practice.","practiceTip":"A 5-minute breathing exercise before study can improve focus and encoding quality.","papers":[{"title":"Mindfulness enhances cognitive functioning: A meta-analysis of 111 RCTs","authors":["Zainal NH","Newman MG"],"year":2023,"evidenceLevel":"meta_analysis","relevanceScore":92,"keyFindings":["Mindfulness improves cognitive functioning across 111 RCTs","Ef